WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.893
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.163 --> 00:19.416
[theme music playing]

3
00:26.549 --> 00:28.008
[liquid bubbling]

4
00:32.763 --> 00:35.432
[clinking, rattling]

5
00:35.516 --> 00:36.684
[cat meows]

6
00:37.560 --> 00:39.728
[hoofbeats]

7
00:41.397 --> 00:42.273
[water splashes]

8
00:49.154 --> 00:51.156
[handcuffs rattling, click]

9
00:55.202 --> 00:58.289
["Drawn (Inst.)" by THAMA playing]

10
01:15.723 --> 01:17.766
["Drawn (Inst.)" by THAMA continues]

11
01:26.567 --> 01:27.818
-[music fades] -[Jae-hee clears throat]

12
01:28.694 --> 01:30.029
I'm guessing we have…

13
01:31.405 --> 01:33.157
things we need to say to each other.

14
01:33.782 --> 01:36.410
There is something I need to say. Yeah.

15
01:36.952 --> 01:38.120
At the time…

16
01:39.371 --> 01:41.874
why'd you bail without listening until I was done?

17
01:42.291 --> 01:44.919
I thought it was clear that you were confessing your love.

18
01:45.002 --> 01:46.837
I was confessing…

19
01:48.672 --> 01:50.090
to you, Yoon Yi-jun.

20
01:50.174 --> 01:52.051
["Drawn (Inst.)" by THAMA playing]

21
01:52.134 --> 01:54.094
-Huh? -[sighs] Gosh,

22
01:54.178 --> 01:56.847
you should've continued listening, but you didn't.

23
01:56.931 --> 01:59.600
-You… meant me? -[Jae-hee] I'm in love.

24
01:59.683 --> 02:02.686
I'm in love with Yoon Yi-jun.

25
02:02.770 --> 02:03.771
[gasps in realization]

26
02:04.897 --> 02:06.440
[exclaims]

27
02:07.942 --> 02:09.568
[chuckles]

28
02:10.903 --> 02:12.738
So then I was who you meant all along?

29
02:12.821 --> 02:13.822
[chuckles softly]

30
02:13.906 --> 02:15.950
I totally misjudged the situation.

31
02:23.457 --> 02:24.625
Sorry.

32
02:30.089 --> 02:32.049
["Drawn (Inst.)" by THAMA continues]

33
02:32.132 --> 02:33.217
Oh, the bus is here.

34
02:34.885 --> 02:35.928
Come on, let's go.

35
02:36.512 --> 02:37.471
What? Me?

36
02:37.805 --> 02:38.806
Oh.

37
02:39.890 --> 02:41.016
[Jae-hee] I'm paying for two.

38
02:41.100 --> 02:42.810
-[machine beeps] -[Yi-jun chuckles] We're doing this?

39
02:43.644 --> 02:46.271
[bus doors hiss shut]

40
02:47.064 --> 02:48.524
I like the back seats the most.

41
02:49.149 --> 02:50.567
-[Yi-jun] Me too. -[Jae-hee chuckles]

42
02:51.694 --> 02:53.737
-[Jae-hee] You've taken the bus before? -[Yi-jun] Mm-hmm.

43
02:57.116 --> 02:59.535
-Good night, then. -Huh? You're leaving?

44
03:00.244 --> 03:02.287
You could just stay for a while.

45
03:02.371 --> 03:03.288
Oh!

46
03:04.415 --> 03:05.791
Is that what you want?

47
03:07.001 --> 03:09.086
"Some ramyun and chill?" Was that it?

48
03:09.336 --> 03:10.921
-No, it wasn't! -[flustered, quirky music playing]

49
03:11.005 --> 03:14.508
It's not one of those times where you invite someone in,

50
03:14.591 --> 03:16.552
-so you can, well… -"Well…"

51
03:16.635 --> 03:19.346
Well, that wasn't what I had thought.

52
03:19.430 --> 03:21.640
I mean, why would you suggest so?

53
03:21.724 --> 03:23.017
-[chuckles nervously] -You thought about it.

54
03:23.100 --> 03:24.351
I know you did.

55
03:24.435 --> 03:25.519
-I know you did. -I…

56
03:25.602 --> 03:28.313
I mean, look, look, look, look, look. Why is your ear so red?

57
03:28.397 --> 03:30.190
-It's not red. -[chuckles]

58
03:30.274 --> 03:31.817
I don't like ramyun either.

59
03:32.776 --> 03:33.902
A shame then.

60
03:35.320 --> 03:37.448
I was thinking about it a lot.

61
03:37.906 --> 03:39.241
-Huh? -[Jae-hee chuckles]

62
03:39.324 --> 03:43.579
I'm saying I wanted to go out with you, to go watch a movie with you,

63
03:43.662 --> 03:45.372
-but with you as Yoon Yi-jun. -Oh.

64
03:45.456 --> 03:48.584
I wanted to try normal things that I know everyone else does.

65
03:48.667 --> 03:50.419
-Mm… -I have about

66
03:51.170 --> 03:52.504
50 activities noted down.

67
03:52.588 --> 03:54.757
Fifty? A little overkill.

68
03:56.884 --> 03:57.926
Name one.

69
03:58.010 --> 03:58.969
This was one of those.

70
03:59.595 --> 04:02.973
Seeing my partner, Yoon Yi-jun, return home safely.

71
04:03.390 --> 04:04.683
That's what this was?

72
04:04.767 --> 04:06.018
[gentle music playing]

73
04:06.101 --> 04:07.603
-Another. -Another?

74
04:08.145 --> 04:09.271
There are so many, though.

75
04:09.813 --> 04:12.024
Well, I want to go on a bike ride with you,

76
04:12.357 --> 04:16.487
visit a popular restaurant with you, take a ton of selfies with you,

77
04:16.570 --> 04:18.322
and I want to take a trip with you.

78
04:19.323 --> 04:21.450
Speaking of which, are you free tomorrow?

79
04:21.825 --> 04:23.577
-Really? -Let's do something.

80
04:23.660 --> 04:25.245
[light, flirtatious music playing]

81
04:25.329 --> 04:30.125
Well, you know I'm so busy this week that the weekend's completely packed…

82
04:30.209 --> 04:32.211
-You mean no? -Hold up, there's a but.

83
04:32.294 --> 04:33.629
I wasn't done yet.

84
04:34.713 --> 04:37.132
I can make an exception for Jae-hee.

85
04:41.095 --> 04:42.054
Sleep well.

86
04:44.014 --> 04:44.890
Uh-huh.

87
04:46.016 --> 04:46.892
[Jae-hee chuckles]

88
04:49.436 --> 04:50.312
So long!

89
04:50.687 --> 04:52.064
[chuckles]

90
04:59.655 --> 05:01.865
EPISODE 10

91
05:06.120 --> 05:10.415
[phone alarm ringing]

92
05:11.166 --> 05:12.709
[bright, upbeat music playing]

93
05:12.793 --> 05:14.503
[grunts while stretching]

94
05:18.632 --> 05:22.678
-[phone alarm ringing] -[alarm clocks ringing]

95
05:22.761 --> 05:23.929
[alarms stop]

96
05:24.471 --> 05:25.973
[sighs merrily]

97
05:26.056 --> 05:26.974
KAKAO WEBFICTION / WEBTOON, WHY DON'T YOU KNOW I'M A WOMAN?

98
05:27.057 --> 05:27.933
BY LEE A-HYEON, RYU DO-HA / ONE PUNCH RABBIT

99
05:28.016 --> 05:31.895
I think I should pick the one that I had dry-cleaned.

100
05:31.979 --> 05:33.063
Okay.

101
05:34.106 --> 05:35.107
[gasps]

102
05:35.190 --> 05:37.234
It's not like it's a workday.

103
05:37.317 --> 05:38.610
[sighs]

104
05:38.694 --> 05:40.279
This one's…

105
05:44.116 --> 05:45.200
perfect.

106
05:46.368 --> 05:47.369
All right.

107
05:47.452 --> 05:48.287
[Yi-jun] No!

108
05:48.370 --> 05:49.496
[music screeches to a halt]

109
05:49.580 --> 05:51.165
-[breathes impatiently] -[quirky music playing]

110
05:51.248 --> 05:52.374
[sighs] Not this one.

111
05:53.292 --> 05:54.293
This one, either.

112
05:54.543 --> 05:55.669
Geez…

113
05:57.129 --> 05:58.797
Ugh, I'm overthinking it!

114
05:58.881 --> 06:02.634
I ran all the way here before beginning my day just to see this.

115
06:02.718 --> 06:05.220
[sighs] Worth every second.

116
06:06.138 --> 06:08.891
She told me she had 50 date ideas.

117
06:08.974 --> 06:10.100
[scoffs]

118
06:10.184 --> 06:13.270
But since it's our first date, wouldn't a trip abroad be nice?

119
06:13.353 --> 06:16.607
You're not considering flying private or something douchey, right?

120
06:16.690 --> 06:18.609
Is abroad a bit too much to start?

121
06:18.692 --> 06:20.652
We'll just go somewhere close.

122
06:20.736 --> 06:21.820
Jeju Island's beaches?

123
06:21.904 --> 06:24.239
Yeah. Yachts and fireworks!

124
06:24.323 --> 06:27.367
It's gonna be freezing, but go ahead. [laughs]

125
06:27.451 --> 06:29.077
I might save that for when the weather is better.

126
06:29.620 --> 06:32.289
I'll bring a present, so I'm not empty-handed.

127
06:32.372 --> 06:35.375
Tell me you're not considering buying out the store

128
06:35.459 --> 06:36.877
and wrapping it nicely?

129
06:36.960 --> 06:38.086
Whoa, Mr. Yoon.

130
06:38.170 --> 06:41.673
I mean, I knew you were out of touch, but still…

131
06:41.757 --> 06:44.885
Ugh, I need to step up, since it's our official first date!

132
06:44.968 --> 06:47.512
And for that, you will do something sweeter.

133
06:47.596 --> 06:50.349
A light, fun activity that gets you two to talk!

134
06:50.432 --> 06:51.475
Just go.

135
06:52.893 --> 06:54.728
Didn't you get dumped recently?

136
06:54.811 --> 06:56.647
[whimsical, huffy music playing]

137
07:01.443 --> 07:02.277
She hasn't yet.

138
07:02.819 --> 07:05.030
I'm going to go get ready for my date,

139
07:05.113 --> 07:07.115
since I am not the one who is single.

140
07:07.199 --> 07:08.909
I said she hasn't!

141
07:08.992 --> 07:10.577
We're working on it!

142
07:10.953 --> 07:12.955
[whimsical, huffy music continues]

143
07:18.085 --> 07:19.086
[sighs]

144
07:19.169 --> 07:21.088
[Si-hyun groans]

145
07:24.341 --> 07:25.509
[Yi-jun] Everything's in there?

146
07:25.592 --> 07:27.177
You should know, since you packed it.

147
07:27.261 --> 07:28.720
Don't see me out.

148
07:28.804 --> 07:30.889
Review the termination agreement one more time.

149
07:30.973 --> 07:34.142
But you've already coordinated it all. It's already been signed too.

150
07:34.226 --> 07:35.644
Why else would I call you?

151
07:36.937 --> 07:39.648
[sighs] There are two things you can do to tick off a lawyer.

152
07:39.731 --> 07:42.192
One, have them look at something that's been signed.

153
07:42.276 --> 07:45.153
Two, nitpicking every detail that's drawn up…

154
07:45.237 --> 07:47.656
What happened to Ms. Choi? Isn't this something she would do?

155
07:49.032 --> 07:49.908
[sighs]

156
07:49.992 --> 07:51.118
She quit.

157
07:52.953 --> 07:54.204
Mr. Yoon…

158
07:55.289 --> 07:56.581
I'm deeply sorry.

159
07:56.665 --> 07:58.542
[somber music playing]

160
08:06.300 --> 08:08.260
[Yi-jun] She sold my information to Na-jung

161
08:08.343 --> 08:11.054
and said she saw the gardener tampering with the milk.

162
08:12.347 --> 08:14.182
How long will she continue doing this?

163
08:16.727 --> 08:19.396
So finish telling me. What would piss off a capable lawyer?

164
08:19.479 --> 08:21.148
Ah, two, when you nit--

165
08:21.231 --> 08:23.692
-Wow, interesting. Thank you. -I'm still talking. Hey.

166
08:23.775 --> 08:25.402
Don't come with. Review the document.

167
08:25.485 --> 08:27.654
Two! Nitpicking every detail

168
08:27.738 --> 08:29.948
-that was drawn up and put down! -[door closes]

169
08:30.032 --> 08:31.033
[music ends]

170
08:38.040 --> 08:39.207
[clattering]

171
08:49.509 --> 08:52.596
GROOM KIM GYU-MIN BRIDE LEE HYE-JUNG

172
08:53.722 --> 08:55.515
Look, I was worried for you, that's why!

173
08:55.974 --> 08:58.018
I'm worried that you might be in danger again, like before,

174
08:58.101 --> 08:59.436
just 'cause you know more than you should!

175
09:00.729 --> 09:02.230
[sighs deeply]

176
09:02.314 --> 09:03.899
You want to be trusting again?

177
09:03.982 --> 09:05.567
Haven't you learned?

178
09:06.443 --> 09:07.903
I'm not falling for that again.

179
09:08.403 --> 09:10.405
[emotional music playing]

180
09:14.117 --> 09:14.993
Captain.

181
09:16.161 --> 09:18.497
Yoon Yi-jun called off his wedding for me.

182
09:18.580 --> 09:21.500
[chuckles] That's insane. Really insane.

183
09:21.583 --> 09:22.751
I mean, seriously.

184
09:22.834 --> 09:24.669
You're a professional temptress, my friend.

185
09:24.753 --> 09:28.715
Yup! Which is why I need to watch after him now.

186
09:28.840 --> 09:30.467
Oh, for goodness' sake.

187
09:30.550 --> 09:33.970
I am completely serious. There's no backing down from this.

188
09:34.054 --> 09:36.640
Na Man-seok has to be brought in.

189
09:36.723 --> 09:40.018
I'm going to bring that bastard to justice. You hear me?

190
09:42.354 --> 09:43.605
[Captain Park] All right.

191
09:43.688 --> 09:46.024
Look, I'm getting down on my knees.

192
09:46.108 --> 09:47.317
I am begging you.

193
09:47.401 --> 09:49.486
Don't you remember what you told me that day?

194
09:49.569 --> 09:52.072
You told me to keep going until I found the suspect!

195
09:52.155 --> 09:54.408
-I pierced those words deep into my heart! -[grunts]

196
09:54.491 --> 09:57.869
Hey, I was trying to be cool.

197
09:57.953 --> 09:59.371
Why are you saying this nonsense to me?

198
09:59.454 --> 10:02.457
Whether or not you were just playing, I took you seriously.

199
10:02.833 --> 10:05.460
This case… I need it back.

200
10:05.544 --> 10:08.213
-[sighs wearily] -I'll talk to Yoon Yi-jun, come clean,

201
10:08.296 --> 10:10.674
and ensure that he cooperates. Yeah?

202
10:11.925 --> 10:13.927
[bright music playing]

203
10:14.845 --> 10:16.054
[bubble pops]

204
10:26.314 --> 10:28.483
[indistinct chatter]

205
10:30.110 --> 10:31.486
[pleased hum]

206
10:32.028 --> 10:33.947
-Say, "Ah." -Ah.

207
10:35.157 --> 10:36.450
[pleased hum]

208
10:36.533 --> 10:38.743
[both chuckling]

209
10:46.960 --> 10:49.421
[bright music continues]

210
10:49.504 --> 10:50.630
[laughs]

211
10:50.714 --> 10:51.965
Oh.

212
10:52.924 --> 10:53.925
[exclaims softly]

213
10:57.721 --> 10:58.763
[Jae-hee] Cheese.

214
10:58.847 --> 10:59.890
[gasps]

215
11:00.849 --> 11:04.394
[camera shutter clicking]

216
11:04.686 --> 11:06.688
[both giggling]

217
11:07.272 --> 11:08.732
[both laughing]

218
11:08.815 --> 11:10.066
[gasps excitedly]

219
11:16.323 --> 11:18.241
-[camera shutter clicks] -[music ends]

220
11:21.286 --> 11:22.913
-[quirky music playing] -I thought you were taking a selfie.

221
11:22.996 --> 11:25.874
-I'm sorry. -I wasn't taking one 'cause I wanted to.

222
11:26.500 --> 11:29.794
I was asked to check whether the lenses worked well.

223
11:29.878 --> 11:31.630
Why couldn't they just do it?

224
11:31.713 --> 11:33.465
Let's get a proper look.

225
11:37.135 --> 11:38.178
You look pretty good.

226
11:39.095 --> 11:40.514
-Really? -Mm-hmm.

227
11:40.597 --> 11:41.431
[chuckles]

228
11:41.515 --> 11:45.101
Well, it's not like I was trying extra hard today or anything.

229
11:46.269 --> 11:48.355
It's such a waste,

230
11:48.438 --> 11:49.606
you'll be changing clothes.

231
11:50.190 --> 11:51.107
-Hm? -[music screeches to a halt]

232
11:51.858 --> 11:53.193
-[jaunty music playing] -Oh.

233
11:53.276 --> 11:56.029
-Okay, get dressed and come back. -I don't get why we're--

234
11:56.112 --> 11:58.615
-You can go get changed right over there. -Do I have to change?

235
11:58.698 --> 12:00.158
Come on, try this. Do it for me.

236
12:00.242 --> 12:02.035
-[sighs] I'm not… -Whoa!

237
12:02.118 --> 12:03.912
No, I don't think I can do this.

238
12:03.995 --> 12:06.373
What if something happened while I'm not around?

239
12:06.456 --> 12:10.544
I get that, but how is this at all relevant to our first date?

240
12:10.627 --> 12:12.128
-[Jae-hee] Hey. -Ow, I'm done. I'll stop!

241
12:13.004 --> 12:14.047
Hear me out.

242
12:15.257 --> 12:18.134
The thing is, I really don't want to.

243
12:18.218 --> 12:20.345
I want to do things other normal couples do.

244
12:20.428 --> 12:22.389
You know, right? So, like, the basic things.

245
12:22.472 --> 12:24.891
You know, couples do this as well.

246
12:24.975 --> 12:27.102
I had just spent so much time today…

247
12:27.185 --> 12:29.521
-All right, all right, all right. -[sighs]

248
12:29.604 --> 12:30.689
Things like this?

249
12:31.648 --> 12:32.649
Or this?

250
12:33.567 --> 12:35.318
You can always get that.

251
12:35.819 --> 12:37.654
Now, hurry up and change.

252
12:37.737 --> 12:40.532
Go, go, go, go, go. That's a good boy.

253
12:44.077 --> 12:45.620
[sighs] He's a handful.

254
12:45.704 --> 12:48.957
Um… there's also the things like this.

255
12:49.040 --> 12:49.874
Like what?

256
12:51.459 --> 12:52.502
Hey, stop it.

257
12:53.503 --> 12:54.713
Guess not. [chuckles softly]

258
12:57.841 --> 12:59.467
Wow, you look good.

259
12:59.551 --> 13:01.303
I've always wanted to wear matching sweats.

260
13:01.386 --> 13:03.096
-It's great. -Why is all this necessary?

261
13:03.179 --> 13:05.599
If something bad happens, you'll be standing by my side.

262
13:05.682 --> 13:08.393
I can't exactly be there for you every time, can I?

263
13:08.476 --> 13:10.478
Besides, you're not my boss anymore.

264
13:10.562 --> 13:12.230
I will get you reinstated,

265
13:12.314 --> 13:13.940
so don't worry about that, okay?

266
13:14.024 --> 13:17.611
Just so you know, should something happen to you when I'm not around,

267
13:17.694 --> 13:19.362
I will turn this entire world upside down!

268
13:19.446 --> 13:21.698
Why are you so concerned… [sighs]

269
13:21.781 --> 13:23.742
I guess we can do this,

270
13:23.825 --> 13:25.410
so you won't turn the world upside down.

271
13:26.995 --> 13:29.873
When in danger, your first goal is to escape.

272
13:30.457 --> 13:33.668
Rather than trying to defeat your foe, run away from them, okay?

273
13:33.752 --> 13:35.086
Didn't I tell you?

274
13:35.629 --> 13:37.380
It's not that I can't do it…

275
13:37.964 --> 13:39.049
it's just that I don't.

276
13:40.508 --> 13:41.468
Go on.

277
13:41.551 --> 13:43.511
-Oh, we're sparring now? -Mm-hmm.

278
13:44.554 --> 13:45.722
I won't go easy then.

279
13:45.805 --> 13:48.058
[upbeat pop music playing]

280
13:48.141 --> 13:49.100
[grunts]

281
13:49.684 --> 13:50.685
[grunts]

282
13:51.561 --> 13:52.562
[Jae-hee] Whoa.

283
13:56.274 --> 13:57.901
[grunts]

284
13:57.984 --> 14:00.028
-[chuckles] -Mm-hmm.

285
14:01.529 --> 14:02.530
What did I say?

286
14:02.614 --> 14:03.948
It's not that I can't do it, it's--

287
14:04.032 --> 14:05.116
[grunts]

288
14:05.200 --> 14:06.618
[music fades]

289
14:07.911 --> 14:09.621
Why don't you join me down here?

290
14:09.704 --> 14:11.122
-[chuckles] -[grunts]

291
14:11.206 --> 14:12.624
[bumbling, whimsical music playing]

292
14:12.707 --> 14:15.919
Like I was just telling you, don't try to defeat your foe.

293
14:16.002 --> 14:18.213
-You need to escape right away! -[grunts in pain]

294
14:18.296 --> 14:19.297
[sighs in disappointment]

295
14:19.381 --> 14:21.591
This… [groaning in pain]

296
14:21.675 --> 14:23.259
This isn't a date.

297
14:23.760 --> 14:24.844
-[groaning] -[doorbell ringing]

298
14:31.518 --> 14:34.104
I knew something was up when he had me stay here.

299
14:37.565 --> 14:39.567
[quirky music playing]

300
14:44.155 --> 14:46.116
Why do I keep running into you? What are you doing here?

301
14:46.199 --> 14:48.076
You hoped that I was someone else?

302
14:48.159 --> 14:49.703
[Hye-jung] Why are you standing like that?

303
14:49.786 --> 14:50.745
It's unsettling.

304
14:50.829 --> 14:52.205
Mmm…

305
14:53.164 --> 14:54.165
[inhales]

306
14:54.249 --> 14:58.169
I wonder when Ms. Hye-jung, who looks attractive anywhere we meet,

307
14:58.253 --> 15:00.296
is going to stop being so angry.

308
15:02.424 --> 15:03.508
That day…

309
15:05.301 --> 15:06.553
when you faced danger,

310
15:07.345 --> 15:09.097
confirmed my feelings for you.

311
15:10.223 --> 15:12.058
And I'd make that choice again.

312
15:12.684 --> 15:14.602
When peril blocks your path, I'll deal with it.

313
15:15.937 --> 15:16.938
That's not enough.

314
15:17.063 --> 15:19.399
Even if you had the best of intentions,

315
15:19.482 --> 15:22.193
I'm tired of being tricked and lied to.

316
15:25.238 --> 15:27.574
Sounds like you're speaking from experience.

317
15:28.658 --> 15:29.868
Am I right?

318
15:29.951 --> 15:32.912
You're here for the contract? The chairman really needs it.

319
15:33.580 --> 15:35.039
Tell me or I won't let you enter.

320
15:35.999 --> 15:37.375
[sighs] Can you stop acting like a child?

321
15:37.459 --> 15:38.877
Oh, I insist.

322
15:39.878 --> 15:41.463
What's wrong with one question?

323
15:43.506 --> 15:44.716
And you really think…

324
15:46.301 --> 15:48.011
you can handle the truth?

325
15:50.305 --> 15:51.806
SEOUL METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

326
15:51.890 --> 15:55.101
You know the drill with the suspect, Kim Hak-ju, who died in holding?

327
15:56.186 --> 15:58.188
The special investigation team has been pulled,

328
15:58.271 --> 16:00.398
and Internal Affairs will be taking over.

329
16:00.482 --> 16:01.733
[scoffs]

330
16:02.859 --> 16:04.778
But we don't have the autopsy yet.

331
16:04.861 --> 16:06.237
[Superintendent Ma] That's precisely why!

332
16:06.321 --> 16:09.783
Should the investigation show the suspect was abused while in custody,

333
16:10.158 --> 16:13.703
you won't just be pulled from your duties, you'll be quickly discharged!

334
16:15.038 --> 16:17.123
Get out! [scoffs]

335
16:17.207 --> 16:19.209
[tense music playing]

336
16:20.418 --> 16:21.628
[scoffs]

337
16:23.379 --> 16:24.839
[door closes]

338
16:27.759 --> 16:28.718
[section chief clears throat]

339
16:28.802 --> 16:30.804
What did the autopsy show?

340
16:30.887 --> 16:32.222
[section chief] What we expected.

341
16:32.305 --> 16:34.057
Multiple substances,

342
16:34.140 --> 16:36.267
with alprazolam being the most present.

343
16:36.893 --> 16:39.312
He overdosed, by will or force.

344
16:39.395 --> 16:40.772
However…

345
16:42.398 --> 16:44.108
I was told to say nothing.

346
16:44.526 --> 16:46.861
Looks like your team is going to be blamed for this.

347
16:48.655 --> 16:49.989
Tread lightly, okay?

348
16:50.073 --> 16:52.075
[tense music continues]

349
16:55.411 --> 16:56.788
-[music ends] -[Yi-jun sighs]

350
16:58.373 --> 16:59.499
[groans]

351
17:00.124 --> 17:02.794
You said you'd go easy, yet it's still sore.

352
17:02.877 --> 17:04.921
Hey, loosen up a little, dude.

353
17:05.004 --> 17:05.964
I'll pay for lunch.

354
17:06.047 --> 17:07.257
Plus, I wanted to talk.

355
17:07.340 --> 17:08.508
I get to choose the restaurant.

356
17:08.591 --> 17:10.635
I was gonna take care of everything today.

357
17:10.718 --> 17:12.720
And how do I know this plan isn't a dud?

358
17:13.179 --> 17:14.973
[sighs] You don't wanna try?

359
17:15.056 --> 17:16.224
I didn't say that.

360
17:17.183 --> 17:19.102
But we don't know each other that well yet…

361
17:19.185 --> 17:21.437
Well, I know everything there is to know.

362
17:22.146 --> 17:22.981
I do as well.

363
17:23.523 --> 17:26.776
Well, I think we should ease into it, and play it slow.

364
17:26.860 --> 17:28.653
Well, if that's what you really want,

365
17:28.736 --> 17:30.446
we can go to a restaurant that you want to go to.

366
17:30.530 --> 17:32.824
[cheerful guitar music playing]

367
17:35.577 --> 17:36.494
Wait a minute.

368
17:37.245 --> 17:39.289
Did I just double-check this with you?

369
17:39.372 --> 17:41.499
And moreover, I enjoyed it?

370
17:41.583 --> 17:43.001
-[chuckles] -[huffs]

371
17:43.084 --> 17:46.129
I wish every Taekang employee could've witnessed that go down.

372
17:46.212 --> 17:48.756
I mean, imagine the sight of me getting bossed by you.

373
17:48.840 --> 17:50.508
I should have filmed it all.

374
17:50.592 --> 17:51.551
[Jae-hee's dad] Dumpling delivery!

375
17:58.016 --> 17:59.267
No way!

376
17:59.350 --> 18:00.685
[laughs]

377
18:00.768 --> 18:01.728
My goodness,

378
18:01.811 --> 18:03.146
-if it isn't the greatest de-- -[Jae-hee] Hey, Dad. Come.

379
18:04.355 --> 18:05.732
Whoa.

380
18:09.527 --> 18:11.571
-Hey. -Your voice, you need to lower your voice.

381
18:11.654 --> 18:13.573
I haven't told him about work.

382
18:13.656 --> 18:14.741
Well, why not?

383
18:14.824 --> 18:17.118
Hey, where would he find another pretty detective?

384
18:17.201 --> 18:18.494
Shh!

385
18:18.578 --> 18:19.829
Lower your voice for me, please.

386
18:19.913 --> 18:22.040
Hold on. You said he was engaged.

387
18:22.582 --> 18:23.917
Is he seeing you on the side?

388
18:24.000 --> 18:25.001
Why that little…

389
18:25.084 --> 18:27.211
No, Dad. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

390
18:28.796 --> 18:30.423
[whispers] I'm undercover right now.

391
18:31.132 --> 18:33.426
[cautious, quirky music playing]

392
18:33.843 --> 18:34.844
Ah…

393
18:36.137 --> 18:37.388
-Just a moment. -Undercover?

394
18:39.057 --> 18:41.184
I was planning to tell him,

395
18:41.935 --> 18:43.561
but then it got complicated.

396
18:44.145 --> 18:45.188
Nothing can be done.

397
18:45.271 --> 18:46.356
[Jae-hee sighs]

398
18:47.523 --> 18:48.524
Jae-hee.

399
18:48.608 --> 18:49.609
[music stops]

400
18:50.360 --> 18:54.238
Don't use "nothing can be done" as an excuse for settling.

401
18:55.239 --> 18:58.868
Life has taught me that the things that you settle for aren't worth it.

402
18:58.952 --> 19:02.163
You can't unlock the next door if you keep all your old keys.

403
19:02.747 --> 19:03.706
Mm-hmm.

404
19:06.459 --> 19:08.920
Geez. Did I take too long?

405
19:09.754 --> 19:10.755
[sighs]

406
19:13.091 --> 19:14.092
What's with that look?

407
19:14.968 --> 19:16.761
-Are you embarrassed? -Huh?

408
19:16.844 --> 19:18.930
Why didn't you let me say a word to your father?

409
19:19.013 --> 19:20.306
You don't understand--

410
19:20.390 --> 19:22.058
You didn't give me the chance to introduce myself.

411
19:22.141 --> 19:24.102
Why would I be embarrassed?

412
19:24.185 --> 19:26.521
My dad's talkative and would've annoyed us both. That's--

413
19:26.604 --> 19:27.897
You could've introduced us.

414
19:27.981 --> 19:29.315
You'll have your chance.

415
19:29.691 --> 19:30.775
[clears throat]

416
19:30.858 --> 19:32.026
[playful music playing]

417
19:32.694 --> 19:33.528
[whispers] What are you doing?

418
19:35.905 --> 19:37.532
[Jae-hee's dad] So you must be the hotshot…

419
19:37.615 --> 19:38.449
[sighs]

420
19:38.533 --> 19:39.575
…good-looking…

421
19:41.327 --> 19:42.620
wealthy employer…

422
19:44.330 --> 19:48.292
who has torn my daughter Jae-hee's precious heart to shreds.

423
19:48.376 --> 19:49.377
[grunts softly]

424
19:49.711 --> 19:51.129
Why are you just saying things?

425
19:51.212 --> 19:52.088
Wait, what did I do?

426
19:52.171 --> 19:53.381
Oh. [sighs]

427
19:54.882 --> 19:56.342
-[music ends] -[inhales sharply]

428
19:57.176 --> 19:58.970
I feel like I need to apologize.

429
20:00.263 --> 20:02.348
-Yoon Yi-jun's my name. -[Jae-hee's dad] I see.

430
20:02.432 --> 20:03.850
Hear me well when I say this.

431
20:05.101 --> 20:08.354
If you were to ever hurt my girl, you'll end up with bloody tears.

432
20:08.438 --> 20:10.773
[tense, whimsical music playing]

433
20:10.857 --> 20:13.943
And I'll plaster said bloody tears-- [grunts in pain]

434
20:14.027 --> 20:14.861
…everywhere.

435
20:15.361 --> 20:16.779
I'm as savage as can be.

436
20:19.032 --> 20:20.867
-Don't forget it. -Yes, sir.

437
20:20.950 --> 20:22.785
[softly] Go away.

438
20:24.954 --> 20:26.039
[Jae-hee's dad] I'm going.

439
20:27.540 --> 20:30.460
[tense, whimsical music swells]

440
20:30.543 --> 20:31.711
[exhales]

441
20:31.794 --> 20:32.712
[music ends]

442
20:33.087 --> 20:34.088
[sighs]

443
20:34.547 --> 20:35.798
[Yi-jun inhales deeply]

444
20:39.719 --> 20:41.846
Looks like you were raised by a loving dad.

445
20:41.929 --> 20:42.847
Hm?

446
20:42.930 --> 20:44.348
Is that why you're so nice?

447
20:44.432 --> 20:45.391
[chuckles]

448
20:45.475 --> 20:48.269
[whimsical music playing]

449
20:51.439 --> 20:53.316
I want to get some food.

450
20:53.399 --> 20:56.486
The place I'm taking you to has amazing food.

451
20:56.569 --> 20:57.487
Okay.

452
21:00.031 --> 21:02.784
KUNMANDU

453
21:07.080 --> 21:08.539
[Jae-hee] Wow.

454
21:10.416 --> 21:11.250
Mm.

455
21:11.709 --> 21:13.086
While it looks delicious,

456
21:13.169 --> 21:16.172
why would you bring me to your parents' place without warning?

457
21:16.255 --> 21:18.800
Well, you know, I was never warned before seeing the chairman.

458
21:20.301 --> 21:22.345
Anyway, now that you're here with me…

459
21:22.804 --> 21:24.055
that's about all there is to know.

460
21:25.014 --> 21:26.849
That's all good,

461
21:26.933 --> 21:29.519
but I feel like we're not alone, and it's a little creepy.

462
21:29.602 --> 21:31.145
[sighs]

463
21:31.229 --> 21:33.981
Mother. And Daddy, please.

464
21:34.065 --> 21:35.483
[Jae-hee's mom, awkwardly] Oh, hey there.

465
21:35.566 --> 21:37.610
-[chuckles] -[whimsical music playing]

466
21:37.693 --> 21:38.986
[whispers] You need to stop.

467
21:39.070 --> 21:40.988
[both grunting]

468
21:46.327 --> 21:47.829
[music ends]

469
21:48.704 --> 21:49.956
[Jae-hee chuckles softly]

470
21:50.790 --> 21:53.126
So, have you been eating home-cooked meals every day?

471
21:54.502 --> 21:56.587
[sighing]

472
22:00.883 --> 22:02.510
POLICE KANG JAE-HEE

473
22:02.593 --> 22:04.262
[tense, dramatic music playing]

474
22:04.345 --> 22:07.473
I work for the Seoul Metro Police as a Special Investigative Detective.

475
22:11.227 --> 22:12.395
[sighs]

476
22:13.771 --> 22:17.733
The department thought you were involved in Han Eun-young's murder

477
22:17.817 --> 22:20.486
and I was assigned to be your personal secretary to find out more.

478
22:21.279 --> 22:22.697
What are you trying to tell me?

479
22:24.574 --> 22:26.075
After watching you closely,

480
22:26.159 --> 22:27.910
I found out you weren't the murderer,

481
22:27.994 --> 22:30.246
and I've protected you since then,

482
22:30.329 --> 22:32.373
while obtaining more evidence on finding the culprit.

483
22:34.333 --> 22:35.668
[Jae-hee sighs]

484
22:35.751 --> 22:36.752
Sorry.

485
22:38.296 --> 22:42.592
I was lying about work, and my gender.

486
22:42.675 --> 22:44.677
[tense, dramatic music continues]

487
22:55.229 --> 22:57.440
Come on, can you wait a second?

488
22:59.609 --> 23:02.820
Kang Jae-hee, you totally conned the entirety of Taekang.

489
23:03.112 --> 23:05.406
I'm telling you this is way more serious than lying about your gender.

490
23:05.489 --> 23:09.202
Please, Yoon Yi-jun, forgive me just once more.

491
23:09.285 --> 23:10.786
I mean, I get wanting justice,

492
23:11.787 --> 23:13.414
but what if you got caught?

493
23:13.998 --> 23:15.416
[breathes deeply]

494
23:15.499 --> 23:17.001
You know, at the time,

495
23:17.835 --> 23:20.838
I had no idea that I would fall for you as much as I did.

496
23:21.297 --> 23:24.717
And I didn't think I'd find someone I'd risk everything for.

497
23:24.800 --> 23:26.969
The way you drive me crazy is a real talent.

498
23:28.804 --> 23:31.182
Honestly, when I was lying at first,

499
23:31.265 --> 23:33.142
I got confused with it all.

500
23:33.893 --> 23:34.936
Now I mean it for real.

501
23:35.603 --> 23:39.357
I tried not to like you, though it didn't really work out that way.

502
23:39.440 --> 23:40.816
[chuckles]

503
23:41.442 --> 23:44.320
You lied the whole time. Why'd you bother falling for me?

504
23:44.403 --> 23:46.030
-[huffs] -[whimsical music playing]

505
23:46.113 --> 23:48.574
Hey, but you're the one who fell for me first.

506
23:48.658 --> 23:49.951
And you made the first move.

507
23:50.534 --> 23:53.663
How could you tell me that when I had no choice?

508
23:54.413 --> 23:56.040
Can you stop the attitude?

509
23:57.750 --> 24:00.628
I… I need to think it over.

510
24:00.711 --> 24:03.130
Take your time. I understand.

511
24:03.464 --> 24:04.674
[Yi-jun sighs]

512
24:09.136 --> 24:10.471
[sighs]

513
24:12.473 --> 24:14.475
[whimsical music continues]

514
24:16.727 --> 24:17.937
So, think about it.

515
24:18.020 --> 24:21.857
And how am I supposed to with you sticking to me like a wad of gum?

516
24:21.941 --> 24:23.067
All right.

517
24:24.277 --> 24:25.486
I'll be down here.

518
24:26.362 --> 24:27.238
[dull thud]

519
24:27.321 --> 24:28.364
Hey!

520
24:28.447 --> 24:29.365
PERSONNEL FILE

521
24:29.448 --> 24:30.408
[Na-jung] Ha!

522
24:30.491 --> 24:32.076
This is just ridiculous!

523
24:32.952 --> 24:34.412
[gasps] The police?

524
24:35.162 --> 24:36.455
Whoa, hold on.

525
24:36.539 --> 24:38.332
Aren't they supposed to play by the book though?

526
24:38.416 --> 24:39.792
I knew it all along.

527
24:40.167 --> 24:44.630
No one's ever passed up the cash, plus she refused it too quickly.

528
24:44.714 --> 24:46.882
We post an exclusive. I could do that instead.

529
24:47.717 --> 24:50.720
We'd want this story to blow up so she doesn't run.

530
24:50.803 --> 24:51.721
[Na-jung] And if it does?

531
24:51.804 --> 24:54.432
Taekang will also get chastised for failing to catch on.

532
24:54.515 --> 24:56.225
That makes sense. [sighs]

533
24:56.309 --> 24:58.853
And if your father flipped out, it'd be a real shit show.

534
24:58.936 --> 25:02.273
We need to solve this problem without dirtying our hands.

535
25:03.149 --> 25:04.734
[tense music playing]

536
25:04.817 --> 25:06.986
[chuckles]

537
25:09.071 --> 25:10.781
REGIONAL TALENT SCHOLARSHIP PRESENTATION CEREMONY

538
25:10.865 --> 25:11.991
[Na-jung] What's all this?

539
25:12.533 --> 25:13.659
Ooh!

540
25:13.993 --> 25:16.203
You've got a lot of cool photos here.

541
25:16.620 --> 25:18.247
I should have come sooner.

542
25:18.331 --> 25:19.665
-[Mr. Na] You're always welcome. -[chuckles]

543
25:20.708 --> 25:24.128
And I should bring out some tea, since my beloved niece is here.

544
25:24.211 --> 25:25.546
Let's see.

545
25:25.629 --> 25:27.089
Forget the tea.

546
25:28.549 --> 25:29.967
That's not what I want.

547
25:30.051 --> 25:31.677
[tense music continues]

548
25:36.724 --> 25:38.517
The accumulated earnings you siphoned,

549
25:40.686 --> 25:41.896
let's split the money, okay?

550
25:43.814 --> 25:45.900
You and all your jokes.

551
25:45.983 --> 25:48.486
I can't believe you came here for that nonsense.

552
25:49.320 --> 25:53.741
Why do you suppose Father kept silent about Yoon Yi-jun?

553
25:54.950 --> 25:57.036
You mean his terminating the engagement?

554
25:57.119 --> 26:00.873
Yi-jun is starting to take after my sister. [chuckles]

555
26:01.457 --> 26:04.752
When it came to matters of the heart, well, your mother was something else.

556
26:04.835 --> 26:05.711
[chuckles]

557
26:05.795 --> 26:08.547
I know what they both often used to discuss.

558
26:08.631 --> 26:10.424
[tense, dramatic music playing]

559
26:10.508 --> 26:13.052
Father and son conversations are so predictable.

560
26:14.220 --> 26:15.429
Did they discuss work?

561
26:15.513 --> 26:18.140
Collecting information is what I do,

562
26:18.224 --> 26:20.768
and in reality, Yoon Yi-jun had baited you,

563
26:20.851 --> 26:22.686
and you wasted no time getting reeled in.

564
26:22.770 --> 26:23.813
[clicks tongue]

565
26:23.896 --> 26:26.065
He used that to cut a deal with Father.

566
26:26.148 --> 26:30.027
I've heard rumors that Yi-jun's been looking into our retained earnings.

567
26:30.694 --> 26:32.279
I was so proud of him.

568
26:33.280 --> 26:35.533
Issues are meant to get solved.

569
26:35.616 --> 26:37.576
I know it's been eating you up inside.

570
26:37.660 --> 26:39.286
[Na-jung chuckles]

571
26:40.413 --> 26:42.498
Seeing how far you went to siphon that money,

572
26:42.581 --> 26:43.624
it'd be tragic to lose it.

573
26:43.707 --> 26:46.085
Had it not been for me, you could've gotten caught.

574
26:46.168 --> 26:49.171
Then I suppose Yi-jun will have to find at least a small amount of evidence

575
26:49.255 --> 26:51.048
so he doesn't let everyone down,

576
26:51.132 --> 26:53.551
including you, Ms. Yoon.

577
26:54.135 --> 26:55.428
You see?

578
26:56.095 --> 26:57.054
[scoffs]

579
26:59.014 --> 27:00.433
I'll pay a retainer.

580
27:00.516 --> 27:01.725
I'm not shameless, you know.

581
27:02.268 --> 27:04.103
[tense, dramatic music continues]

582
27:05.438 --> 27:07.565
This is worth a small fortune.

583
27:08.357 --> 27:09.483
Really think about it.

584
27:09.567 --> 27:11.402
[breathes deeply]

585
27:11.485 --> 27:15.906
With this here, you'll be handing Yoon Yi-jun's leash right to Father.

586
27:18.868 --> 27:19.702
Huh?

587
27:19.785 --> 27:20.786
[music fades]

588
27:26.250 --> 27:28.127
[Na-jung humming]

589
27:31.589 --> 27:34.550
POLICE OFFICER PERSONNEL FILE

590
27:34.633 --> 27:35.968
[scoffs]

591
27:36.051 --> 27:37.803
[unsettling music playing]

592
27:37.887 --> 27:40.514
[chuckles]

593
27:44.268 --> 27:47.354
CHAIRMAN YOON TAE-SIK

594
27:47.938 --> 27:50.441
[Na-jung] I need you to do what you do best.

595
27:50.524 --> 27:53.444
Create some chaos, and then clean up the mess.

596
27:55.696 --> 27:56.614
Man-seok.

597
27:59.033 --> 28:00.117
How may I help?

598
28:05.706 --> 28:06.582
Was it you?

599
28:08.083 --> 28:10.085
[sinister music playing]

600
28:10.586 --> 28:11.837
It wasn't, sir.

601
28:13.088 --> 28:15.716
Why would I dare do such a terrible thing?

602
28:16.967 --> 28:19.094
Yi-jun said he'll get it resolved.

603
28:19.178 --> 28:20.679
He'll find who did it.

604
28:22.097 --> 28:23.307
Only time will tell.

605
28:24.225 --> 28:26.018
Time will tell indeed, sir.

606
28:31.398 --> 28:32.983
I wanted to show you something.

607
28:44.453 --> 28:45.579
What are they trying to pull?

608
28:50.376 --> 28:52.461
[Yi-jun] There must be something that singles it out.

609
28:52.545 --> 28:55.005
Equal amounts transferred in regular intervals

610
28:55.089 --> 28:56.549
should be a major red flag.

611
28:57.841 --> 28:59.468
[Min-hwan] Just a moment, Mr. Yoon.

612
28:59.552 --> 29:01.720
[tense music playing]

613
29:02.304 --> 29:04.932
Payments were made from the foundation's account to an individual.

614
29:06.392 --> 29:08.435
From its account wired to an individual?

615
29:10.271 --> 29:11.230
Huh?

616
29:11.313 --> 29:13.357
[Min-hwan] I'm not authorized to access this.

617
29:13.440 --> 29:14.942
[inhales sharply]

618
29:15.025 --> 29:17.611
Use financial records to bypass it.

619
29:20.948 --> 29:22.241
[kiosk beeps]

620
29:22.324 --> 29:23.284
ADD NUTTY SHOT

621
29:23.367 --> 29:24.285
[kiosk beeps]

622
29:24.368 --> 29:25.953
[automated voice] Please confirm your order.

623
29:26.996 --> 29:30.416
I might drink less coffee. Mm.

624
29:30.916 --> 29:32.710
[Hye-jung] And you really think…

625
29:32.793 --> 29:34.295
you can handle the truth?

626
29:34.378 --> 29:35.671
[pensive, quirky music playing]

627
29:35.754 --> 29:36.839
"Honestly, I'm in debt."

628
29:37.631 --> 29:39.383
"Don't worry about it. I'm well off."

629
29:40.301 --> 29:42.553
"Honestly, I have a husband, and three kids."

630
29:42.636 --> 29:45.389
That's not where this was going. Mm.

631
29:46.932 --> 29:48.309
"Honestly, I am totally a man."

632
29:49.184 --> 29:52.271
Nope, Ms. Hye-jung is the last person I'd be confused over.

633
29:52.354 --> 29:53.355
[chuckles] Like, come on.

634
29:56.859 --> 29:58.902
-She's pretty. -[cafe staff] Your drinks are ready.

635
29:59.695 --> 30:01.322
I've got this covered.

636
30:01.405 --> 30:02.740
If Yi-jun did it, so can I.

637
30:03.657 --> 30:04.658
[music fades]

638
30:08.203 --> 30:09.288
[Si-hyun sighs]

639
30:10.581 --> 30:13.834
I'm now ready. I'm ready for it all. Mm-hmm.

640
30:14.293 --> 30:16.629
-It's about the chairman. -Huh? The chairman?

641
30:17.421 --> 30:19.048
Why bring him up now?

642
30:19.131 --> 30:21.050
Uh, well, the chairman's a bit much.

643
30:21.133 --> 30:22.468
Continue though. Yeah.

644
30:23.469 --> 30:26.180
He said Jae-hee is with the authorities.

645
30:27.640 --> 30:29.016
Word is both of them were summoned,

646
30:29.099 --> 30:31.435
and she was investigating the Ms. Han case…

647
30:31.935 --> 30:34.897
[sighs] She went way too far by lying to Mr. Yoon.

648
30:36.148 --> 30:38.484
Do you think that what she did was wrong?

649
30:40.361 --> 30:42.363
And what if she was just doing her job?

650
30:42.988 --> 30:46.033
Could it be… you already knew this?

651
30:49.328 --> 30:52.039
TAEKANG GROUP CHAIRMAN'S OFFICE

652
30:52.122 --> 30:54.124
[solemn, suspenseful music playing]

653
31:06.553 --> 31:10.808
Senior Patrol Officer with the SMPA, Jae-hee Kang.

654
31:13.018 --> 31:14.520
You should always expect

655
31:14.603 --> 31:17.773
the worst possible outcome when working.

656
31:17.856 --> 31:19.483
And prepare for any contingencies.

657
31:20.651 --> 31:24.071
From what I see… you failed to do so.

658
31:26.073 --> 31:27.449
[Yi-jun] My father's a businessman.

659
31:28.033 --> 31:29.451
So think of this as a sale.

660
31:29.952 --> 31:31.286
You need to stay a step ahead.

661
31:31.870 --> 31:36.625
THE DAY BEFORE

662
31:36.709 --> 31:40.796
How dare you, a dirty cop, deceive Taekang. Shame!

663
31:41.088 --> 31:42.214
Shame on you!

664
31:42.297 --> 31:43.632
And what do you mean by that?

665
31:44.633 --> 31:48.220
If it weren't for Kang Jae-hee, your only son would be dead by now.

666
31:48.721 --> 31:50.264
I couldn't really brag before,

667
31:51.014 --> 31:52.474
since it would've shamed our family,

668
31:52.558 --> 31:55.269
but Jae-hee saved me on countless occasions.

669
31:55.352 --> 31:56.687
Tell him about them all.

670
31:57.396 --> 31:58.814
You watch it.

671
31:58.897 --> 32:00.482
I will give the commissioner a call.

672
32:00.566 --> 32:02.276
[tense, dramatic music playing]

673
32:02.359 --> 32:03.235
Mr. Chairman,

674
32:03.902 --> 32:07.072
I wouldn't have had to do so if he wasn't exposed.

675
32:07.156 --> 32:09.950
There was a tampered chandelier that nearly fell on his head,

676
32:10.033 --> 32:11.994
and the milk that he drinks every day

677
32:12.077 --> 32:14.747
was spiked with an herbicide from a Taekang subsidiary.

678
32:14.830 --> 32:16.206
-[Yi-jun gasps] -[Jae-hee] Watch out!

679
32:16.290 --> 32:18.000
[Jae-hee] The accident on the day of the memorial

680
32:18.542 --> 32:20.252
was caused by tampered brakes.

681
32:20.544 --> 32:24.423
The suspect we caught that day ended up being murdered while in custody.

682
32:25.924 --> 32:28.552
Knowing your plan to eventually give him Taekang,

683
32:28.635 --> 32:30.637
his safety is of vital importance.

684
32:31.597 --> 32:34.016
Stop beating around the bush and spit it out!

685
32:35.476 --> 32:38.312
I will be responsible for his safety while he works.

686
32:39.313 --> 32:41.106
Just please let me stay close to him.

687
32:43.525 --> 32:45.444
I believe I've repaid the debt I owed.

688
32:45.527 --> 32:47.029
[Yi-jun] It's a bit too soon for that.

689
32:47.654 --> 32:49.698
We have until the shareholder meeting.

690
32:49.782 --> 32:51.074
Then I want some results.

691
32:51.158 --> 32:53.952
Restore it all to the way it was, as promised.

692
32:54.453 --> 32:55.287
Yeah.

693
32:56.914 --> 32:57.748
Yeah.

694
32:57.831 --> 32:59.792
I don't make deals where I stand to lose.

695
33:03.045 --> 33:04.171
You know that, though.

696
33:05.339 --> 33:06.507
[knocking on door]

697
33:06.882 --> 33:07.925
Come in.

698
33:08.008 --> 33:09.927
[tense, anticipatory music playing]

699
33:18.435 --> 33:19.770
So you're also here.

700
33:19.853 --> 33:21.271
[inhales shakily]

701
33:26.109 --> 33:27.110
[music ends]

702
33:31.490 --> 33:34.076
By now, something should've exploded.

703
33:34.701 --> 33:36.245
Where is my update?

704
33:36.578 --> 33:38.580
[subdued, tense music playing]

705
33:38.664 --> 33:40.541
EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR YOON NA-JUNG

706
33:41.959 --> 33:44.002
Did Uncle make off with the cash?

707
33:45.629 --> 33:46.630
[music ends]

708
33:50.717 --> 33:53.387
Hello. Why are you here late?

709
33:53.470 --> 33:55.681
I'm bringing him Q3 results.

710
33:56.640 --> 33:58.100
He wanted to go discuss the hotel?

711
33:59.643 --> 34:00.769
Uh…

712
34:00.853 --> 34:02.437
Well, I was just passing by.

713
34:04.022 --> 34:07.067
Back in there, I saw Yi-jun and his personal secretary.

714
34:07.150 --> 34:07.985
Really?

715
34:08.610 --> 34:11.113
Did Father make threats? Is he enraged?

716
34:11.196 --> 34:13.657
[chuckles softly] It truly wasn't that bad in there.

717
34:14.783 --> 34:17.286
I think Yi-jun was able to convince Father.

718
34:17.369 --> 34:18.745
[groans] Geez.

719
34:18.829 --> 34:20.539
And I agreed with his point of view.

720
34:20.622 --> 34:24.835
Yi-jun seems happy where he's at, so I told him he should wait it out.

721
34:25.502 --> 34:26.503
Are you for real?

722
34:27.170 --> 34:29.006
You think you're Mother Teresa?

723
34:29.631 --> 34:31.425
All that work for nothing.

724
34:31.508 --> 34:33.051
Why didn't I let Jun-hyun release it?

725
34:33.135 --> 34:34.845
What plan are you concocting?

726
34:34.928 --> 34:37.639
It's my business, okay? Geez.

727
34:38.432 --> 34:39.308
Na-jung.

728
34:41.476 --> 34:43.103
Keep pushing your luck, dear sister…

729
34:44.897 --> 34:45.981
and you'll see.

730
34:47.983 --> 34:48.817
What?

731
34:48.901 --> 34:50.861
-[tense music playing] -[chuckles softly]

732
34:50.944 --> 34:52.821
I'm tired of worrying about you.

733
35:07.419 --> 35:10.255
[Jae-hee] The chief secretary reported everything to him.

734
35:10.380 --> 35:12.799
When I arrived, he knew all about our team.

735
35:12.883 --> 35:14.009
[Wan-gu sighs]

736
35:14.092 --> 35:18.305
Thank God that I had gone to Chairman Yoon and confessed to everything earlier.

737
35:18.388 --> 35:19.723
[exhales]

738
35:19.806 --> 35:22.017
I'm really sorry that I acted on my own without permission.

739
35:22.100 --> 35:25.228
Wait a sec. You told the truth?

740
35:25.312 --> 35:26.229
Mm-hmm.

741
35:26.313 --> 35:29.274
That you're a detective who's currently undercover? All of it?

742
35:30.984 --> 35:32.444
It was out of my hands.

743
35:32.527 --> 35:33.737
[sighs deeply]

744
35:33.820 --> 35:36.365
[suspenseful music playing]

745
35:36.448 --> 35:37.741
[gasps softly]

746
35:40.369 --> 35:42.663
-You did good, okay? -Oh.

747
35:42.746 --> 35:44.748
Wow! I would have expected no less from you.

748
35:44.831 --> 35:46.500
-I did good? -Yes, you did!

749
35:46.583 --> 35:47.626
-[laughs] -Hey, we should all come clean

750
35:47.709 --> 35:48.543
-and be free! -I did good?

751
35:48.627 --> 35:50.629
They reduce sentences when you're honest.

752
35:50.712 --> 35:52.047
-Amazing idea. -[Wan-gu laughs]

753
35:52.130 --> 35:54.591
Yeah, well done! That was stellar!

754
35:54.675 --> 35:56.718
Wow! Well done, you're the best we've got. [laughs]

755
35:56.802 --> 35:58.971
What happened to wanting to keep a low profile?

756
35:59.054 --> 36:01.974
I guess it's important to adjust to any situation.

757
36:02.057 --> 36:03.600
We must save ourselves!

758
36:03.684 --> 36:06.395
[laughs uneasily]

759
36:07.980 --> 36:11.650
However, I heard with Chairman Yoon there's always a catch.

760
36:11.733 --> 36:14.236
I mean, what if he goes back on his word?

761
36:14.319 --> 36:17.322
-[crying] -We need more evidence to pin Na Man-seok.

762
36:18.365 --> 36:20.242
We lack investigative power. What can we do?

763
36:20.325 --> 36:22.160
[sighs] We need authority.

764
36:22.244 --> 36:25.122
[sighs] You're right. Authority, authority.

765
36:25.247 --> 36:26.456
Oh, God…

766
36:27.165 --> 36:28.583
I'm glad you made a move.

767
36:28.667 --> 36:30.877
Although I think she's pretty daring.

768
36:30.961 --> 36:32.337
She is indeed.

769
36:33.588 --> 36:35.090
Mastered six martial arts,

770
36:35.173 --> 36:37.092
was in the Special Forces,

771
36:37.175 --> 36:38.343
-and became a detective. -[quirky music playing]

772
36:38.427 --> 36:41.138
Stop twisting my words to what you want to hear.

773
36:41.221 --> 36:43.598
This isn't a moment to go and gloat about her to me.

774
36:43.682 --> 36:45.642
Ms. Kang Jae-hee has you hooked.

775
36:45.726 --> 36:47.394
I was not gloating.

776
36:47.477 --> 36:48.979
I was merely stating the facts.

777
36:49.062 --> 36:51.148
Whatever, yeah, yeah, yeah.

778
36:51.606 --> 36:53.734
You know, you should just focus on the upcoming meeting.

779
36:53.817 --> 36:54.818
[music ends]

780
36:56.028 --> 36:57.112
I think I've got a lead.

781
36:58.071 --> 36:59.072
You found an account?

782
36:59.990 --> 37:01.825
I knew you seemed too relaxed.

783
37:01.908 --> 37:03.785
We're getting close, huh?

784
37:03.869 --> 37:06.121
I've been with my dad a long time.

785
37:07.581 --> 37:08.707
He's a real businessman.

786
37:09.541 --> 37:12.586
-And yet, she didn't back down, not once. -Who's that?

787
37:13.545 --> 37:14.713
-Kang Jae-hee, of course. -[playfully exasperated music playing]

788
37:15.172 --> 37:17.299
I mean, she didn't bat an eye or anything.

789
37:17.382 --> 37:20.302
Gosh, I was insanely proud of her.

790
37:20.385 --> 37:22.220
Hold up a minute, what am I doing?

791
37:22.304 --> 37:23.847
Better buy her something.

792
37:25.932 --> 37:28.310
Oh, my God, shopping? I'm a little concerned.

793
37:28.393 --> 37:29.936
Bulgogi.

794
37:30.020 --> 37:32.647
-Wagyu. Top-shelf. -[phone chirps]

795
37:34.274 --> 37:36.276
-Dr. Kim. -[Yi-jun] How do I buy it?

796
37:36.359 --> 37:37.903
You do psych consults, right?

797
37:37.986 --> 37:38.987
[music ends]

798
37:39.321 --> 37:41.198
[sighs] Sorry I'm late.

799
37:41.990 --> 37:43.033
What took you so long?

800
37:43.116 --> 37:46.495
Wan-gu has a habit of going off topic every time he has the chance.

801
37:48.288 --> 37:49.456
What's this?

802
37:49.539 --> 37:50.540
You made all this?

803
37:50.624 --> 37:53.877
Like I said, it's not that I can't do it, it's just that I don't.

804
37:56.254 --> 37:58.757
-Wow. -What? You falling in love?

805
37:59.925 --> 38:01.802
Hey, you're practically sparkling.

806
38:03.595 --> 38:05.347
This steak is…

807
38:05.430 --> 38:07.474
Oh, it looks incredible, right?

808
38:07.557 --> 38:09.559
-Sit down. -[sighs]

809
38:12.312 --> 38:13.980
Wow.

810
38:16.274 --> 38:17.192
Yoon Yi-jun.

811
38:18.110 --> 38:20.278
-Wanna get engaged? -What?

812
38:20.737 --> 38:22.781
Well, you're rich and handsome,

813
38:22.864 --> 38:24.491
and you're a really good cook.

814
38:25.117 --> 38:26.701
-Kang Jae-hee. -Hmm?

815
38:28.912 --> 38:30.163
Go eat your steak.

816
38:30.247 --> 38:31.456
[laughs]

817
38:31.540 --> 38:32.916
Quit messing around.

818
38:34.042 --> 38:36.336
-I'll be back soon. -Mm-hmm.

819
38:39.673 --> 38:40.966
Wow, it's amazing.

820
38:41.842 --> 38:44.136
-Amazing! -[Yi-jun] Eat as much as you want.

821
38:44.219 --> 38:46.179
-There isn't a lot. -[Yi-jun] There's more.

822
38:46.263 --> 38:48.306
-Seriously? -[Yi-jun] I spent five million won.

823
38:49.349 --> 38:52.102
[chuckles] Wow, I could've used that money.

824
38:54.938 --> 38:57.941
["Drawn" by THAMA playing]

825
39:00.235 --> 39:01.528
Wait.

826
39:01.611 --> 39:02.737
What's this?

827
39:02.821 --> 39:04.030
YI-JUN, JAE-HEE YOUR HEART HAS TO FLUTTER FOR ME

828
39:04.322 --> 39:05.240
Well…

829
39:08.326 --> 39:09.619
[grunts, then laughs]

830
39:09.703 --> 39:10.662
[chuckles softly]

831
39:10.745 --> 39:11.955
[gasps]

832
39:12.038 --> 39:13.748
-[Jae-hee] Take that. -Well…

833
39:13.832 --> 39:15.125
[chuckles]

834
39:15.208 --> 39:17.586
[both laughing]

835
39:22.340 --> 39:26.219
At first glance, our captain seems like your average, ordinary middle-aged guy,

836
39:26.303 --> 39:28.096
yet he knows a lot more than us.

837
39:28.180 --> 39:29.681
Oh.

838
39:29.764 --> 39:30.974
Wan-gu's the funny one.

839
39:31.057 --> 39:35.270
He's always got this tough-guy act, yet he's the largest wuss that's in there.

840
39:35.353 --> 39:37.647
He's so freaking cute. [laughs]

841
39:40.817 --> 39:41.985
I guess you like your coworkers?

842
39:42.068 --> 39:43.528
Oh, you have no clue.

843
39:44.070 --> 39:48.283
They are all just as special to me as Sergeant Go was. Every one.

844
39:49.117 --> 39:51.203
Our captain, Wan-gu as well…

845
39:51.286 --> 39:54.372
Ah! Seok-jin's a Police University graduate,

846
39:54.456 --> 39:55.874
and how do I put this?

847
39:55.957 --> 39:58.335
I guess he's a great role model.

848
40:01.755 --> 40:03.506
You know, I went over to him and said,

849
40:03.590 --> 40:05.717
"You are such an incredible senior.

850
40:05.800 --> 40:08.845
Although, the man I love is Yoon Yi-jun.

851
40:08.929 --> 40:10.597
Yoon Yi-jun is my man."

852
40:10.680 --> 40:11.848
[grunts] That's it.

853
40:11.932 --> 40:13.099
Tell me then.

854
40:13.975 --> 40:15.393
When did you start having feelings?

855
40:16.061 --> 40:16.978
Quite a while ago.

856
40:17.062 --> 40:21.233
So was that before or after you suddenly pushed me away that one day?

857
40:21.316 --> 40:22.609
Before.

858
40:25.111 --> 40:26.863
I have no self-respect.

859
40:26.947 --> 40:28.323
Always needing to check in.

860
40:28.406 --> 40:30.408
-[huffs] -[chuckles]

861
40:31.243 --> 40:34.788
I don't know if I've ever considered myself to be lucky,

862
40:35.288 --> 40:37.249
but all my luck brought you to me.

863
40:37.332 --> 40:39.751
That wasn't luck. It's you.

864
40:39.834 --> 40:40.835
Hm?

865
40:40.919 --> 40:42.879
You had worked hard to enter my world after all.

866
40:43.713 --> 40:47.133
I don't think meeting you was a coincidence.

867
40:47.217 --> 40:48.051
It's fate.

868
40:48.635 --> 40:49.552
[chuckles]

869
40:56.935 --> 41:00.272
["Drawn" by THAMA continues]

870
41:13.493 --> 41:15.787
-[phone blaring] -[music stops]

871
41:17.706 --> 41:20.083
[sighs] They need me at the station,

872
41:20.875 --> 41:22.294
which means I should go.

873
41:22.377 --> 41:24.087
-Really? -[sighs]

874
41:24.170 --> 41:25.839
-I can take you. -No, no, no.

875
41:26.256 --> 41:28.883
It's all right. I just need one of your cars.

876
41:28.967 --> 41:30.010
I'm sorry!

877
41:30.885 --> 41:32.512
Hang on, I can take you there.

878
41:32.595 --> 41:34.597
-[Jae-hee] I'll call you later! -[phone buzzes]

879
41:40.603 --> 41:43.398
[Min-hwan] Mr. Yoon, I just sent you the accounting file.

880
41:43.481 --> 41:45.483
[tense music playing]

881
41:47.736 --> 41:50.238
TAEKANG FOUNDATION ACCOUNTING MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

882
41:53.241 --> 41:55.702
ACCOUNT NUMBER

883
41:59.039 --> 42:01.499
-[phone chirps] -[line rings]

884
42:01.583 --> 42:02.709
[Min-hwan] Yes, Mr. Yoon.

885
42:02.792 --> 42:03.835
I got it.

886
42:04.502 --> 42:07.422
Compare the flow of retained earnings to affiliated individuals.

887
42:07.964 --> 42:08.840
-Yes, sir. -[doorbell ringing]

888
42:11.551 --> 42:13.553
[suspenseful music playing]

889
42:15.680 --> 42:16.806
Was that the doorbell?

890
42:19.809 --> 42:21.686
Does anyone else know where you are?

891
42:24.731 --> 42:26.358
Well, uh, I don't believe so.

892
42:27.275 --> 42:28.818
[thunder rumbling]

893
42:28.902 --> 42:30.278
Do not open it.

894
42:31.237 --> 42:32.489
I'm on my way.

895
42:34.074 --> 42:36.076
[suspenseful music continues]

896
42:49.089 --> 42:51.174
DOOR CAMERA

897
42:56.429 --> 42:58.473
[suspenseful music swells, fades]

898
42:58.556 --> 43:01.518
Captain, why are we the only ones here?

899
43:01.601 --> 43:03.228
Something happening to the team?

900
43:04.145 --> 43:06.106
Yeah? You mean right now?

901
43:06.189 --> 43:07.232
Look, she's here.

902
43:07.315 --> 43:08.733
Are you really sure?

903
43:08.817 --> 43:12.195
He's hidden in a safehouse, in case of something like this.

904
43:12.278 --> 43:14.197
Good, so no one can find him.

905
43:14.697 --> 43:16.991
I don't want something bad to happen again because of me…

906
43:17.075 --> 43:18.410
[Jae-hee] That's not gonna happen.

907
43:18.493 --> 43:20.495
[unsettling music playing]

908
43:22.872 --> 43:23.706
[Mr. Na] You may begin.

909
43:23.790 --> 43:24.707
TAEKANG FOUNDATION CHAIRMAN NA MAN-SEOK

910
43:25.083 --> 43:27.127
-[Jae-hee] I'm on the way. -[Wan-gu] Where are you…

911
43:27.210 --> 43:28.920
Where the hell do you think you're going?

912
43:32.924 --> 43:35.301
Get a load of these stupid dickheads!

913
43:35.385 --> 43:38.513
Seriously! You think this is an action movie and you're all the stars?

914
43:41.057 --> 43:41.933
Undercover cop?

915
43:43.476 --> 43:45.186
Illegal operation.

916
43:45.270 --> 43:47.188
A violation of regulations!

917
43:47.272 --> 43:49.107
Ignoring commanding officers!

918
43:49.190 --> 43:51.151
Altering operational plans!

919
43:52.402 --> 43:53.445
Hey!

920
43:54.529 --> 43:56.906
Hey! You think it's a joke?

921
43:56.990 --> 43:58.783
Your own little playground, yeah?

922
43:59.325 --> 44:01.703
Because of you the organization's going to shit!

923
44:01.786 --> 44:03.246
Hey, hands off!

924
44:04.747 --> 44:06.124
Hands off my team.

925
44:07.417 --> 44:08.668
I can deal with it.

926
44:09.294 --> 44:11.921
[tense music playing]

927
44:16.217 --> 44:17.051
[grunts]

928
44:17.135 --> 44:20.221
Brace yourself for the severe consequences that await you.

929
44:24.058 --> 44:27.770
You're being disbanded at once, 'cause of your transgressions.

930
44:29.272 --> 44:30.565
[sighs]

931
44:30.648 --> 44:34.819
Until you hear otherwise, you're all to stay here!

932
44:35.320 --> 44:36.279
Understood?

933
44:37.030 --> 44:38.490
-[groans in pain] -[Wan-gu] Captain!

934
44:38.573 --> 44:40.241
That's nothing, you little shits.

935
44:50.251 --> 44:52.045
[Na-jung] Park Min-hwan, the accounting manager.

936
44:52.962 --> 44:54.547
You know where he is, don't you?

937
44:56.883 --> 44:58.843
CALLING MOBILE PHONE

938
44:58.927 --> 45:01.846
-[phone line ringing] -[ominous music playing]

939
45:01.930 --> 45:03.556
You have 40 minutes.

940
45:03.640 --> 45:06.768
Take care of it before I get there, and leave nothing behind.

941
45:21.199 --> 45:23.618
[automated voice] The number you have dialed cannot be…

942
45:23.701 --> 45:25.537
[Wan-gu sighs deeply]

943
45:32.043 --> 45:33.002
[Wan-gu] Where are you going?

944
45:33.086 --> 45:34.963
Our team's done and now we're on standby.

945
45:35.046 --> 45:35.964
Didn't you hear?

946
45:36.047 --> 45:39.217
If something happened to Park Min-hwan, Yoon Yi-jun could be in danger too.

947
45:39.300 --> 45:42.053
-Move aside. -Hey, look out for yourself first!

948
45:42.136 --> 45:44.597
You're the one who will get hurt doing things like this.

949
45:44.681 --> 45:46.140
Let me go, Captain! Please just let me!

950
45:46.224 --> 45:47.308
No way!

951
45:47.850 --> 45:49.352
[sighs in frustration]

952
45:49.644 --> 45:51.354
[Seok-jin] Isn't it strange?

953
45:51.646 --> 45:52.772
The timing?

954
45:52.855 --> 45:55.233
[tense music playing]

955
45:56.609 --> 46:00.071
The chief secretary must've known Detective Kang met with Chairman Yoon,

956
46:00.655 --> 46:03.366
and we've confirmed his connection to Superintendent Ma.

957
46:03.449 --> 46:06.452
And considering his temper, he should've grilled us harder.

958
46:07.787 --> 46:09.914
Captain, please. It was always their plan.

959
46:09.998 --> 46:12.083
Which means trouble for Mr. Yoon.

960
46:12.166 --> 46:13.251
[Captain Park] Kang Jae-hee!

961
46:28.641 --> 46:30.059
-[police siren wailing] -[Captain Park sighs]

962
46:30.143 --> 46:32.145
For the record, I told you guys to stay.

963
46:32.228 --> 46:34.397
I can't cover for you, so you're all on your own.

964
46:34.480 --> 46:36.941
[Wan-gu] Oh, please, when have you ever covered for us?

965
46:37.984 --> 46:39.277
[Captain Park] Come on, step on it!

966
46:41.112 --> 46:42.280
[Wan-gu] Oh, hurry.

967
46:44.115 --> 46:47.118
[suspenseful music playing]

968
46:50.121 --> 46:51.831
[door keypad beeping]

969
46:51.914 --> 46:53.124
[door lock chimes]

970
46:55.877 --> 46:57.211
[Yi-jun] Mr. Park Min-hwan!

971
47:07.847 --> 47:10.266
Mr. Park Min-hwan! Where are you?

972
47:12.101 --> 47:13.186
Min-hwan!

973
47:26.616 --> 47:28.618
[suspenseful music continues]

974
47:53.059 --> 47:55.061
[suspenseful music swells]

975
48:00.775 --> 48:01.943
[music fades]

976
48:06.489 --> 48:08.491
[somber music playing]

977
48:10.952 --> 48:12.328
Just forget it and look at me.

978
48:14.330 --> 48:15.248
You're okay.

979
48:57.832 --> 48:59.167
[Mr. Na] I, Na Man-seok,

980
48:59.667 --> 49:03.671
admit to embezzling millions of Taekang's retained earnings

981
49:04.672 --> 49:07.759
and wish to take responsibility for my actions with this.

982
49:07.842 --> 49:10.845
[indistinct chatter]

983
49:12.096 --> 49:13.806
Get your camera ready.

984
49:13.890 --> 49:17.852
[Tae-sik] "I've left all relevant assets and documents in my office."

985
49:19.020 --> 49:21.022
[Mr. Na] I will carry all the blame to the grave,

986
49:21.606 --> 49:25.109
so I am asking you all, for the sake of Taekang,

987
49:25.193 --> 49:26.527
that you bury me with everything.

988
49:26.611 --> 49:27.862
"…that you bury me with everything."

989
49:27.945 --> 49:29.864
Geez. [shouts furiously]

990
49:33.659 --> 49:35.244
And that accountant?

991
49:36.245 --> 49:37.747
Did he run away with the money?

992
49:39.290 --> 49:40.541
[Mi-jin] Father.

993
49:44.879 --> 49:46.547
[Tae-sik] Which one of you leaked this?

994
49:47.215 --> 49:50.760
Was I not clear when I told you to keep matters within these walls?

995
49:53.137 --> 49:54.972
It wasn't anyone from the family…

996
49:56.140 --> 49:58.643
We know not to talk to the press about Taekang.

997
49:59.060 --> 50:00.728
We still have standards.

998
50:01.813 --> 50:04.106
I thought you wouldn't let us be a punching bag.

999
50:04.190 --> 50:06.067
Didn't you say you'd handle it?

1000
50:07.735 --> 50:08.694
[sighs]

1001
50:08.778 --> 50:09.654
Go ahead.

1002
50:20.998 --> 50:23.584
[tense, dramatic music playing]

1003
50:33.052 --> 50:33.970
[gasps]

1004
50:34.679 --> 50:36.514
[gasps]

1005
50:39.767 --> 50:40.810
Stop this.

1006
50:40.893 --> 50:43.229
Father, what about Uncle's funeral first?

1007
50:43.312 --> 50:44.772
Run an article covering this.

1008
50:45.398 --> 50:48.526
Sacrifice those idiots that dared to mock Taekang!

1009
50:48.609 --> 50:49.902
Anything to cover this up.

1010
50:52.989 --> 50:54.198
[Superintendent Ma] Please forgive us, sir.

1011
50:56.075 --> 50:59.120
I have already spoken to the police commissioner.

1012
50:59.203 --> 51:01.956
The commissioner was outraged that we sabotaged

1013
51:02.039 --> 51:05.001
this organization with this illegal investigation.

1014
51:05.084 --> 51:07.086
Since they've caused so much trouble,

1015
51:07.169 --> 51:09.839
and acted in direct violation of their responsibilities,

1016
51:09.922 --> 51:14.886
he vowed to use all the correct channels to dismiss every officer involved!

1017
51:15.428 --> 51:16.262
[gasps]

1018
51:16.345 --> 51:17.263
[Jae-hee] Wait, sir.

1019
51:17.889 --> 51:18.890
[gasps]

1020
51:20.558 --> 51:21.851
It was just me.

1021
51:21.934 --> 51:24.520
I'm the one who suggested we investigate.

1022
51:24.604 --> 51:25.813
-[Superintendent Ma] Stay out of this. -[Captain Park] Kang Jae-hee.

1023
51:25.897 --> 51:28.274
I was the only one who wanted to see it through.

1024
51:28.357 --> 51:32.528
I needed to find the perpetrator, and keep Mr. Yoon safe from harm.

1025
51:35.489 --> 51:37.825
Sir, I was in charge. As team captain--

1026
51:37.909 --> 51:39.994
-What are you doing? -Stop interrupting!

1027
51:40.536 --> 51:42.580
Sir, I am… I am the one to blame.

1028
51:42.663 --> 51:44.290
-Are you crazy? -Detective Kang

1029
51:45.041 --> 51:46.542
was acting on my commands.

1030
51:46.626 --> 51:49.295
My sincerest apologies. It's my fault.

1031
51:49.378 --> 51:50.963
I hope that I can be forgiven.

1032
51:51.923 --> 51:53.007
[Superintendent Ma] Apologies, sir.

1033
51:53.090 --> 51:55.593
Don't punish my department for the mistakes I made.

1034
51:55.676 --> 51:56.761
Talk to the commissioner.

1035
51:56.844 --> 51:59.305
Please be merciful, for the love of God!

1036
51:59.388 --> 52:01.807
[tense, dramatic music continues]

1037
52:11.692 --> 52:12.652
That's enough.

1038
52:13.611 --> 52:15.738
Get up, Kang Jae-hee, now!

1039
52:24.497 --> 52:26.666
Do we really need to take it this far?

1040
52:27.833 --> 52:29.085
I don't accept losing.

1041
52:33.047 --> 52:33.965
[thuds]

1042
52:37.218 --> 52:39.428
[somber music playing]

1043
53:05.621 --> 53:07.039
[Jerry purring]

1044
53:24.390 --> 53:26.183
[breathes deeply]

1045
53:26.767 --> 53:27.977
[elevator button beeps]

1046
53:39.947 --> 53:41.407
[tense music playing]

1047
53:41.490 --> 53:44.535
I know you had no intention of opposing the authorities.

1048
53:45.202 --> 53:47.705
And you took advantage by threatening to dismiss those officers.

1049
53:48.414 --> 53:50.249
You knew Jae-hee would take the blame, no?

1050
53:50.332 --> 53:52.043
And you knew that this would leave me no choice.

1051
53:53.627 --> 53:55.129
So just get to the point.

1052
53:55.463 --> 53:56.547
[Yi-jun] That position.

1053
53:57.006 --> 54:01.218
This all started because of that position that I never wanted to begin with,

1054
54:01.927 --> 54:03.345
and it's all going to stop.

1055
54:03.554 --> 54:04.555
[chuckles]

1056
54:04.972 --> 54:06.140
Is it really now?

1057
54:07.475 --> 54:08.476
I can't deny it.

1058
54:08.559 --> 54:10.478
I fell a little short this time.

1059
54:11.270 --> 54:12.605
Park Min-hwan is gone…

1060
54:13.314 --> 54:15.524
and then, I have no idea who else is involved.

1061
54:16.567 --> 54:18.736
It just shows how much danger surrounds me.

1062
54:18.819 --> 54:21.322
That's why she can't stand where I stand.

1063
54:21.405 --> 54:23.407
[tense music continues]

1064
54:26.077 --> 54:27.369
Your choice to fire them…

1065
54:28.704 --> 54:29.622
please reconsider.

1066
54:31.499 --> 54:33.084
And I'll make sure you never lose.

1067
54:38.798 --> 54:40.508
[music ends]

1068
54:50.601 --> 54:52.603
[sinister music playing]

1069
54:52.686 --> 54:53.646
[gunshot]

1070
54:58.025 --> 54:59.026
[gunshot]

1071
55:06.784 --> 55:08.119
[gunshot]

1072
55:10.621 --> 55:11.914
[sighs]

1073
55:19.004 --> 55:20.339
I appreciate all you do.

1074
55:22.424 --> 55:23.425
With pleasure.

1075
55:27.179 --> 55:29.181
[sinister music swells]

1076
55:32.893 --> 55:33.894
[music ends]

1077
55:34.228 --> 55:36.147
[automated voice] The number you have dialed cannot be…

1078
55:36.272 --> 55:39.316
-[phone chirps] -[line rings]

1079
55:46.031 --> 55:48.033
I was worried since you weren't answering.

1080
55:48.993 --> 55:50.369
I'm here to tell you something.

1081
55:52.746 --> 55:54.415
Mm-hmm. Go on.

1082
55:55.207 --> 55:56.250
I'm breaking this off.

1083
55:57.168 --> 55:59.295
[poignant, melancholic music playing]

1084
55:59.962 --> 56:02.089
[chuckles incredulously] What about all we've been through?

1085
56:02.715 --> 56:04.550
If everyone on your unit is fired,

1086
56:05.426 --> 56:07.553
do you believe you could live with all that guilt?

1087
56:08.554 --> 56:10.306
You're barely getting by as it is.

1088
56:11.098 --> 56:12.975
I am… I'm looking for a solution.

1089
56:13.058 --> 56:14.518
-If we just put-- -[Yi-jun] What about me?

1090
56:14.602 --> 56:17.188
Want me to live my life feeling sorry about what I did?

1091
56:17.271 --> 56:19.356
This family and environment…

1092
56:19.440 --> 56:21.358
I didn't ask to be born into this situation.

1093
56:21.442 --> 56:22.443
What else am I supposed to do?

1094
56:22.526 --> 56:23.819
And what if I just…

1095
56:25.446 --> 56:27.156
decide to stay despite those?

1096
56:35.581 --> 56:38.125
You could never break their hearts no matter what you do.

1097
56:38.751 --> 56:40.169
I know you too well.

1098
56:40.753 --> 56:41.962
But then I'd be…

1099
56:43.214 --> 56:44.924
doing the same thing to you.

1100
56:46.091 --> 56:48.302
[emotional ballad music playing]

1101
56:52.681 --> 56:53.974
I'll adjust to it.

1102
56:55.851 --> 56:57.061
And live with it.

1103
56:57.436 --> 56:58.646
[scoffs]

1104
57:00.439 --> 57:02.650
So you need to return to your life before we met,

1105
57:03.651 --> 57:05.361
and I will return to my life as well.

1106
57:08.447 --> 57:09.365
Kang Jae-hee.

1107
57:13.410 --> 57:14.328
Take care.

1108
57:18.874 --> 57:20.042
That's all you got?

1109
57:21.335 --> 57:22.628
Nothing else to say?

1110
57:24.463 --> 57:25.756
You're really leaving?

1111
57:28.217 --> 57:30.636
How could you ask me to give up on you like this?

1112
57:30.719 --> 57:33.222
I no longer want to be a coward and hide, okay?

1113
57:35.933 --> 57:37.226
Take care.

1114
57:41.105 --> 57:43.482
I don't want this. Don't go.

1115
57:43.983 --> 57:46.694
Yoon Yi-jun. Yoon Yi-jun!

1116
57:50.322 --> 57:52.324
[emotional ballad music continues]

1117
58:02.293 --> 58:03.877
I don't want you to go.

1118
58:06.088 --> 58:08.674
[sobbing]

1119
58:20.519 --> 58:21.895
[sobbing continues]

1120
58:43.125 --> 58:46.045
[closing theme music playing]

1121
59:05.064 --> 59:06.023
SPECIAL THANKS TO KIM DO-YOON, JUNG YOO-MIN, PARK JUN-MUYN

1122
59:06.106 --> 59:06.982
FOR THEIR SPECIAL APPEARANCE

1123
59:11.070 --> 59:13.238
I broke up with her. God, I miss her.

1124
59:13.322 --> 59:14.823
[Jae-hee] I've never loved this hard before,

1125
59:14.907 --> 59:16.742
so I don't know how to get over him.

1126
59:16.825 --> 59:17.868
[Yi-jun] We're practically strangers now.

1127
59:17.951 --> 59:19.620
Then what's this? It feels like your heart's racing.

1128
59:19.703 --> 59:21.872
[Yi-jun] My existence itself is a threat to Kang Jae-hee.

1129
59:21.955 --> 59:24.458
I'd like to ask for your help with an investigation.

1130
59:24.541 --> 59:26.418
To think you'd break from something so minor.

1131
59:26.502 --> 59:28.087
She's making the first move soon.

1132
59:28.170 --> 59:29.213
Did he tell you to keep me here?

1133
59:29.296 --> 59:30.881
-[Si-hyun] What do you mean? -[Yi-jun] The last chance to lose me.

1134
59:30.964 --> 59:33.133
We sincerely cared for each other,

1135
59:33.217 --> 59:34.927
and loved each other immensely.

1136
59:35.010 --> 59:39.098
Kang Jae-hee, do you think we'll do the same in our next life?
